  "community_quote_1": "“There is no such thing as luck when winning in the markets; there is only well-analyzed data and proven algorithms. Most investors believe that prices are guided by market news or random fluctuations. They are wrong.",
  "community_quote_2": "A massive, silent, and 'invisible' data pool is running behind your screen: Gamma levels, Delta positions, Vanna flows, hidden dynamics of order books, and many other factors steer the market second by second... So markets do not move randomly at the end of the day; they progress on tracks built by large liquidity flows, parallel to this massive data that you cannot notice or analyze well.",
  "community_quote_3": "From the complex webs of Wall Street to the depths of BIST, we try to bring to your screen that analytical power which moves the price and is thought to be 'invisible' and 'impossible to track'. nFinans, under the umbrella of PriVYAlgo, illuminates this data left in the dark; we make these hidden maps, which 90% of investors in the market are deprived of, visible to you retail investors with advanced",
  "community_quote_4": "analysis tools, software, and data analysis terminals.”",
